{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261124/photo/bkn-20261124201314147-1124_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261124213443\"/><p>涉事單位的屋外亦放置雜物。(陳嘉順攝)</p><p>今晚(24日)7時12分，一名66歲婦人懷疑於柴灣翠樂邨翠祿樓的家中暈倒，由丈夫發現後致電報案。消防接報趕至，發現屋內堆滿雜物，女事主被困走廊動彈不得，隨即搬開雜物拯救她，惟她當時已氣絕身亡。案件暫列「屍體發現」跟進，女事主的死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T14:04:05.948823+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T12:13:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T14:17:20.645528+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T13:57:19.417336+00:00","content_hash":"d7e95236c6930be4d588effa93e76940fc0fd1b953cf7e02102e2c3a9f552502","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T14:04:05.948823+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}